<title>HONG KONG: DC Finance says to buy HK$165 mln office.</title>
<headline>DC Finance says to buy HK$165 mln office.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mortgage loan financing and property investment firm DC Finance (Holdings) Ltd said on Friday it has agreed to buy a Grade A office property in North Point on Hong Kong Island for HK$165.68 million cash.</p>
<p>The company said it would fund the purchase by internal resources and bank borrowings.</p>
<p>The property is an office floor with total gross floor area of 20,972 square feet in Island Place Tower, a development which is expected to be completed on April 30, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
